<title>UK: Novorossiisk, Ventspils oil ports reopen.</title>
<headline>Novorossiisk, Ventspils oil ports reopen.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Black Sea oil port of Novorossiisk was open on Tuesday morning after a closure due to high winds, a shipping source said.</p>
<p>The port reopened at 1530 local time on Monday having been shut on Sunday evening because of force 8-9 winds.</p>
<p>In the Baltic, pipeline deliveries to the Latvian port of Ventspils had resumed having been shut off on Monday morning as storage tanks reached capacity.</p>
<p>The port was open and operating normally, the shipping source said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
